{"unit_id":"lauytgary__dsh_hud_plugin#card-zh","repo":"lauytgary/dsh_hud_plugin","commit":"64eec0b708694833eb0434f538c8aa0d0cdc1457","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stats-hud 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 界面的科幻风会话统计 HUD。它作为浏览器侧插件接入 composer dock，在页面右侧固定显示，不替换原有统计行。面板汇总步骤与回合数、LLM 和工具耗时比例、每秒令牌吞吐量、上下文占用及缓存命中情况，并以滚动计数器呈现令牌变化。窗口空间不足时会切换为精简视图，窄于 800 像素时隐藏。适合希望在 DSH 对话中持续查看运行和令牌指标的用户；插件读取 DSH 提供的会话投影数据，不需要额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:527-591","lib/client.js:440-443"]}
{"unit_id":"lauytgary__dsh_hud_plugin#card-en","repo":"lauytgary/dsh_hud_plugin","commit":"64eec0b708694833eb0434f538c8aa0d0cdc1457","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-stats-hud adds a sci-fi HUD to the DeepSeek Harness web interface. It shows session steps, turns, model and tool time, token throughput, context occupancy and cache hits beside the chat. The panel adapts to available space and reads DSH session data; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:527-591","lib/client.js:440-443"]}
